    {
      "id": 141403,
      "type": "Ultimate",
      "name": { "en": "A Dragon's Zenith Knows No Rue", "zh-CN": "亢龙无悔，移山辟世" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Deals Physical DMG equal to #1[i]% of Dan Heng • Permansor Terrae's ATK to all enemies, and provides a Shield to all allies that can offset DMG equal to #4[f1]% of Dan Heng • Permansor Terrae's ATK plus #5[i], lasting for #6[i] turn(s). When repeatedly receiving Dan Heng • Permansor Terrae's Shield, can stack the Shield Effect, but it will not exceed #7[i]% of the current Shield provided by Skill.\n\"Souldragon\" becomes enhanced. When \"Souldragon\" takes action, launches Follow-Up ATK, dealing Physical DMG to all enemies equal to #2[i]% of Dan Heng • Permansor Terrae's ATK and Additional DMG of the Bondmate's Type to all enemies equal to #8[f1]% of the Bondmate's ATK. The enhancement lasts for #3[i] \"Souldragon\" action(s).",
        "zh-CN": "对敌方全体造成等同于丹恒•腾荒#1[i]%攻击力的物理属性伤害，为我方全体提供能够抵消等同于丹恒•腾荒#4[f1]%攻击力+#5[i]伤害的护盾，持续#6[i]回合。重复获得丹恒•腾荒的护盾时，护盾量可以叠加，最高不超过当前战技提供的护盾量的#7[i]%。\n使【龙灵】获得强化，【龙灵】行动时，发动追加攻击，对敌方全体造成等同于丹恒•腾荒#2[i]%攻击力的物理属性伤害和等同于【同袍】#8[f1]%攻击力的相应属性附加伤害。强化持续【龙灵】#3[i]次行动。"
      },
