      "summary": {
        "en": "Deals massive Physical DMG to all enemies and provides a Shield with stackable Shield Effect to all allies. Enhances \"Souldragon.\" When \"Souldragon\" takes action, launches Follow-Up ATK, dealing minor Physical DMG and minor DMG of the Bondmate's Type to all enemies. The enhancement lasts for 2 \"Souldragon\" action(s).",
        "zh-CN": "对敌方全体造成大量物理属性伤害，并为我方全体提供可叠加护盾量的护盾。并强化【龙灵】，【龙灵】行动时发动追加攻击，对敌方全体造成少量物理属性伤害和少量【同袍】相应属性伤害。强化持续【龙灵】2次行动。"
