      "type": "Technique",
      "name": { "en": "Earthrend", "zh-CN": "地坼" },
      "description": {
        "en": "After using Technique, gains \"Bondmate\" and inflict Daze on enemies within a certain area for #1[i] second(s). Dazed enemies will not actively attack ally targets.\nWhen switching the active character, \"Bondmate\" transfers to the current active character. At the start of the next battle, automatically uses Skill 1 time on the character with \"Bondmate\" without consuming any Skill Points.",
        "zh-CN": "使用秘技后获得【同袍】并使一定区域内的敌人陷入#1[i]秒的晕眩状态，晕眩状态下敌人不会主动攻击我方目标。\n切换行动角色时【同袍】转移至当前行动角色。下一次战斗开始时自动对持有【同袍】的角色施放1次战技，此次战技不消耗战技点。"
      },
